commit f0d5cc86ba3460a2c8e73d734f32a5095d60813a
Author: Paul Holzinger <pholzing@redhat.com>
Date:   Wed Apr 12 13:53:42 2023 +0200

    update clap to v4
    
    `forbid_empty_values` was replaced with `builder::NonEmptyStringValueParser`.
    Also fixes the awkward command structure for the proxy client which
    required an extra argument despite not using it.
    
    Signed-off-by: Paul Holzinger <pholzing@redhat.com>

